<title>ITALY: Alitalia, Singapore airline in cargo deal.</title>
<headline>Alitalia, Singapore airline in cargo deal.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian flag carrier Alitalia and Singapore Airlines have signed a deal to develop a modern cargo management system, Alitalia said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the system aimed to integrate cargo management operations at all levels. It gave no financial or other details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
